  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Investment Programme for Resilience (IPR) is a comprehensive, inclusive, and integrated response to the needs of the most vulnerable/marginalized communities in Palestine.IPR III aims at further expanding the community infrastructure component, to strengthen the access to socio-economic services and to enhance social engagement in marginalized and disadvantaged communities, by rehabilitating/constructing/expanding small-scale needs-based infrastructure, building the capacities of the entitie</narrative>
